  "description": "Give your creative projects a playful twist with this neon gingham seamless pattern in vibrant pink, yellow, blue, and green. The classic woven-check appearance meets an electric color palette of brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green for a fresh, energetic look. This colorful gingham design blends timeless picnic-inspired charm with bold contemporary style, making it a fun choice for digital backgrounds, stationery, packaging, and eye-catching prints. Add a vivid pop of color to everyday designs with this bright and versatile repeating pattern.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 10 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
